# SetTracker Development Rules

- Stack: Java 21, Spring Boot 3.x, PostgreSQL, Spring Data JPA, Spring Security (JWT), Spring WebSocket (STOMP)
- Follow layered architecture: Controller → Service → Repository
- Use DTOs for request/response bodies, never expose entities directly
- Write meaningful commit messages after each completed feature (not one giant commit)
- Add basic unit tests for service-layer logic
- Prefer constructor injection over field injection
- Keep methods small and single-purpose
